{
  "description": "Case 1, direct dependency with a stale lock: BookStack requires guzzlehttp/guzzle ^7.4 and locks 7.4.2, affected by five 2022 advisories fixed in 7.4.5. The root constraint already permits the fix. `composer update guzzlehttp/guzzle` alone stops at 7.4.4 because 7.4.5 needs guzzlehttp/psr7 ^2.4.1, so the human command is `composer update guzzlehttp/guzzle -w`. A second, incidental finding (dompdf via barryvdh/laravel-dompdf ^1.0) can only be fixed by widening the root constraint to ^2.0, which as of 2022-07-01 resolves to a beta because the project allows dev stability.",
